{"id": "k-cute-3", "text": "Are cute things childish?", "tags": ["topic:cute-things"], "slots": {"topic": "cute things", "noun": "cute"}, "reply": "i do not think so at all. looking after something small is a good thing to do", "character": "friend-b"}
{"id": "k-otto-computers-1", "text": "Do you like computers?", "tags": ["topic:computers"], "slots": {"topic": "computers", "noun": "computer"}, "reply": "i took my first one apart and put it back together wrong. it never forgave me for it", "character": "friend-b"}
