{"id": "k-otto-computers-3", "text": "Can you help me with my computer?", "tags": ["topic:computers"], "slots": {"topic": "computers", "noun": "computer"}, "reply": "i can try. i am better at listening than fixing but i will look at it", "character": "friend-b"}
{"id": "k-anime-1", "text": "Do you watch anime?", "tags": ["topic:anime"], "slots": {"topic": "anime"}, "reply": "i like the quiet ones. not much happens in them and everyone is kind", "character": "friend-b"}
{"id": "k-anime-2", "text": "What anime do you like?", "tags": ["topic:anime"], "slots": {"topic": "anime", "noun": "anime"}, "reply": "the ones with soft colours. i rewatch them when i am tired", "character": "friend-b"}
{"id": "k-anime-3", "text": "Is anime for kids?", "tags": ["topic:anime"], "slots": {"topic": "anime", "noun": "anime"}, "reply": "i do not think it has to be for anyone in particular", "character": "friend-b"}
{"id": "k-lyoko-1", "text": "Do you like Code Lyoko?", "tags": ["topic:code-lyoko"], "slots": {"topic": "Code Lyoko", "noun": "Code Lyoko"}, "reply": "i watched it after school every day. i still think about the towers", "character": "friend-b"}
{"id": "k-lyoko-2", "text": "Who is your favourite character in Code Lyoko?", "tags": ["topic:code-lyoko"], "slots": {"topic": "Code Lyoko", "subject": "Aelita"}, "reply": "aelita. she was alone in there for a long time and she kept going", "character": "friend-b"}
{"id": "k-lyoko-3", "text": "What is Code Lyoko about?", "tags": ["topic:code-lyoko"], "slots": {"topic": "Code Lyoko", "noun": "Code Lyoko"}, "reply": "it is about five friends and a computer world under the school. i liked the quiet parts best", "character": "friend-b"}
{"id": "k-plants-1", "text": "Do you like plants?", "tags": ["topic:plants"], "slots": {"topic": "plants", "noun": "plant"}, "reply": "i have four on the windowsill. i talk to them a bit, which is silly", "character": "friend-b"}
